9a2781cf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079433 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079434 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079433 #edb/ref 1061 29131 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079433 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "356ba1a3-2b60-500b-8fc1-84b042470ccf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079433 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186079678 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079434 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079435 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079434 #edb/ref 1061 29132 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079434 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "b61e657a-d112-5829-a63a-d3bd114efbd1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079434 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186078517 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079435 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079468 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079435 #edb/ref 1061 29135 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079435 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "1b787bd9-ff80-5a23-9cd4-1ac7f89a1e06" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079435 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186078518 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079436 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079437 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079436 #edb/ref 1061 29138 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079436 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3d1661fe-98e8-5860-aad0-d3a355a77f07" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079436 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186078519 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079437 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079438 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079437 #edb/ref 1061 29583 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079437 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "834f7693-5561-5b04-a214-445eeb9553b3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079437 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186079679 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079438 #edb/ref 1061 31778 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079438 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c9322ea9-c9d9-50e1-94b8-d4dcd13fdd5a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079438 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186078520 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079468 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186079436 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079468 #edb/ref 1061 44629 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079468 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "65544bc7-c18a-5a7a-9bd2-24d87192b4c6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079468 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186079703 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079678 #edb/ref 1064 "In the coordinate plane, dilations are typically centered at the origin. When a dilation is centered at the origin, it can be represented by a function\n\n$$\n(x,y) \\mapsto (kx, ky)\n$$\n\nwhere $k$ is the scale factor of the dilation.\n\nFor example, let's compute the image of the point $(3,2)$ (shown below) under the action of a dilation with center $O$ and scale factor $3.$ \n\n![](images/2d/2da731925da5705e15cb58abd632e52c04139e8052772eeaa3ca2862fd6d3d02.png)\n\nA dilation with center at the origin and a scale factor of $3$ can be represented by the function\n\n$$\n(x,y) \\mapsto \\left(3x,3y\\right).\n$$\n\nApplying this function to the point $(3,2),$ we have\n\n$$\n(3,2) \\mapsto \\left(3\\cdot 3, \\:3 \\cdot 2 \\right) = (9,6).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the resulting point is $(9,6).$\n\n![](images/94/9410030b5b309d512c937741e9fdb85abad0aacdd712f81ee0b50897523952cc.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079678 #edb/ref 1065 4717 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079678 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "530dc6f3-a090-5cc7-ae83-525ede6c1e2c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079678 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079679 #edb/ref 1064 "If $l$ is a line passing through the center of dilation, then the image $l'$ under the dilation is the same as the original line. \n\n![](images/eb/eb208ea1b492a1d471e0ffb6b3f23fa80a4747f3b5f6da1ad126c30716e52743.png)\n\nHowever, if $k$ is a line that does not pass through the center of dilation, then the image $k'$ is parallel to the original line.\n\n![](images/09/09a11211bde36f85dfe48e4a769314d084edc99c523b869ed3f9a518784fb9a6.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079679 #edb/ref 1065 4773 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079679 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "23754991-48e0-5988-b048-bbdd32cf900d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079679 #edb/ref 1067 "The Image of a Line Under a Dilation" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079703 #edb/ref 1064 "Let's discuss how to find a center of a dilation\n\nThe center of a dilation lies on any line that passes through corresponding points on a figure and its image. Therefore, we can find a center of dilation as the intersection of any two of these lines. \n\nLet's look at some examples:\n\n- Consider the rectangle $ABCD$ and its image $A'B'C'D'$ under the action of a dilation, shown below.\n\n![](images/91/9115c6a43d20f58e8c2e4b9a77337edd18688dd831168405062c6e0fbe207bb0.png)\n\nWe can find the center of dilation $O$ by connecting two corresponding points with a straight line and finding their intersection. \n\nFor example, if we draw the lines $\\overset{\\longleftrightarrow}{AA'}$ and $\\overset{\\longleftrightarrow}{BB'}$ and find their intersection, we get the center of dilation $O$ shown below.\n\n![](images/4a/4a3b1ac04e7d549aafdcf50ea55e172f385fbb7a71bd061c74581ca50f94535a.png)\n\n- Sometimes, a figure and its image lie on opposite sides of the center of dilation. \n\nFor example, consider the rectangle $ABCD$ and its image $A'B'C'D'$ shown below. \n\n![](images/a8/a8918779d1b5152e7071bdb7ba7d349978b166ff613ec2c8b918f9c2ea5b0b92.png)\n\nIf we draw the lines $\\overset{\\longleftrightarrow}{AA'}$ and $\\overset{\\longleftrightarrow}{BB'},$ we find that the center of dilation $O$ lies between the two shapes.\n\n![](images/14/14c6bc0bd148d2ac61c42d4e1636c4301a7af77e773338358e51e4a297f40a48.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079703 #edb/ref 1065 7688 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079703 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "332ed95e-8170-5e85-89b6-a7ea3befd30f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186079703 #edb/ref 1067 "Finding a Center of Dilation" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535454 #edb/ref 1080 "images/fe/fe097fd7a569e551491d6d1ee4959af9d8d6d98e4b0bf78342f3e65c2be2e08a.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535454 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535454 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0b33e64c-d85c-5034-8e80-bf428c69c247" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535475 #edb/ref 1080 "images/70/70ab8c2fe67dbf76952995240d2bdcf102111c2ce8cfe91850886e9a439dcd45.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535475 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535475 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1a665b85-1226-5bdb-bb70-29b874a55538" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535481 #edb/ref 1080 "(-1,0),\\,\\,k=-\\frac{1}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535481 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535481 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1e312727-bada-52b7-812c-8e09bc0642fa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535494 #edb/ref 1080 "images/d2/d238f021b9afd090dbc768cae0a6516969a0b281e88175889c5c616874739f10.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535494 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535494 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2612f47d-0452-52a5-b697-b1b879af646c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535499 #edb/ref 1080 "images/8b/8be8f57344a57823633011369efda0559726af65bac3af2e88ac5323ef653ac6.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535499 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535499 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "29429d07-f776-589c-b450-b75891b15930" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535503 #edb/ref 1080 "images/d6/d6c03d6d7cf77a6cf53bef74f08b823c4c53e60fa500aabeeead4b9fe6aac6d9.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535503 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535503 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2e1b842b-03ba-5e9b-84c1-8c4e10efb822" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535509 #edb/ref 1080 "images/7f/7ffb2de45c233357c4304386595a2a74927e6b916ab45b3e3ffdc0174c2ed720.png" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535509 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535509 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "32dc054f-2980-5bb1-b264-e8fa82722b0f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218653551